{
  "summary": "The tcp_chat repository implements a Python-based chat system composed of three core modules and a test suite using pytest. The underlying communication rules are defined in protocol.py::protocol.py through a line protocol with commands and length-prefixed frames. The server operations are handled by server.py::server.py, which uses a threaded TCP architecture to manage unique nicknames and broadcast messages across clients, while client.py::client.py serves as the command-line chat client."
